; claude: what all the 3D backends share (the 3D Playground's web one,
; the software rasterizer, OpenGL) and the ray tracer: vectors (Vec3),
; the camera (Camera) and its matrices (Mat4), the lighting formula
; (Lighting), rays and what they hit (Ray, shared with physics/3d) and
; what a surface does with light (Material). Depends on nothing. A
; private library (see graphics/core/dune), installed as part of
